# Tam, the Possibility counts planeswalker TYPES, not planeswalkers: Ajani Resolute and Ajani, Outland Chaperone are both
# Ajani, so X is one and the ability asks once (the second refusal fails if a second proliferate is asked). The one choice
# goes to Ajani Resolute, whose two loyalty counters become three; the Chaperone is never chosen and stays at three. Tam's
# reduction paid for both: {1}{W} became {W}, and {1}{W}{W} became {W}{W} from two Plains.

